# triton - knobs live in the QUADLET's Environment= lines (triton.container):
#
#   ACTIVE_MODEL      which model dir tritonserver loads (explicit mode)
#   CONFIG_PROFILE    tensorrt | onnx - named config (<profile>.pbtxt at the
#                     model root), must match the mounted artifact:
#                     .plan -> tensorrt, .onnx -> onnx
#
# Image is the plain vendor tritonserver. Models are host mounts, configs are
# pushed by `make deploy` (Makefile). Changing a model or config = edit +
# restart, never a rebuild.
